    description: "Create dataflow/*.yaml pattern files for the four highest-priority\nlanguages (covering ~90% of PlazaFlow's codebase and most common repos):\n\n- dataflow/python.yaml: assignment, augmented_assignment, call, delete\n- dataflow/javascript.yaml: assignment_expression, variable_declarator,\n  augmented_assignment_expression, delete_expression\n- dataflow/typescript.yaml: (extends javascript.yaml or shares patterns)\n- dataflow/rust.yaml: let_declaration, assignment_expression,\n  reference_expression (mut vs immutable borrows)\n\nEach file is ~10-30 lines. Patterns map tree-sitter node types to\nread/write/mutate/delete roles for left/right/argument positions.\n\nDepends on: YAML loader (to consume these files).\nSee ADR-0015 §4 YAML examples."  # ed00
    fields: {}  # ed00
